# ===== Menu Character Editor (new UI) =====

# ===== Bottom bar menu buttons =====
menu_type => Character Type / 角色类型
menu_char => Character / 角色
menu_hint => Hint / 提示

# ===== Character type names =====
type_opponent => Opponent / 对手
type_boyfriend => Boyfriend / 男友
type_girlfriend => Girlfriend / 女友

# ===== Status label above the panel (current role + offsets) =====
cur_role => Current Character:  / 当前调整角色：

# ===== Character panel field labels =====
lbl_image => Image file name: / 图片文件名：
lbl_idle => Idle animation (.XML): / 空闲动画（.XML）：
lbl_confirm => Start Press animation (.XML): / Start Press 动画（.XML）：
lbl_scale => Scale: / 缩放：

# ===== Character panel actions =====
chk_flip_x => Flip X / 水平翻转
btn_reload => Reload Char / 重新加载角色

# ===== Hint panel =====
btn_load => Load Character / 加载角色
btn_save => Save Character / 保存角色
h_arrow => Arrow Keys - Change Offset (Hold Shift for 10x speed) / 方向键 - 调整偏移（按住 Shift 为 10 倍速）
h_space1 => Space - Play "Start Press" animation / 空格 - 播放 "Start Press" 动画
h_space2 => (Boyfriend Character Type only) / （仅 Boyfriend 角色类型）
h_esc => Esc - Close panel / Exit editor / Esc - 关闭面板 / 退出编辑器
